---
description: Do not weaken tests, plans, or fixtures to make a gate pass
alwaysApply: true
---

# Exit criteria

- Never weaken a test, an assertion, or an exit criterion to make it pass. If a criterion is unreachable as written, stop and say so.
- Don't edit `PLAN.md` or an ADR unless a build produced a result that contradicts it. "Nothing to change" is a valid outcome of a review.
- Fixtures are generated by a committed script or xtask. Don't commit binary media, and don't commit any third-party skin.
